    "en": [
      "A vintage black-and-white postcard depicting a broad, tree-lined boulevard with elegant late-19th or early-20th-century European buildings. The main building on the left displays the sign 'SUNDSVALLS SPARBANK' (Sundsvall Savings Bank). Several people are walking along the street and paths, and the setting appears to be a city center or prominent avenue. The style suggests Northern European architecture."
